WEBVTT

1
00:00:47,714 --> 00:00:51,885
BERDASARKAN KISAH CINTA NYATA

2
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:13,388
"Aku," kataku.

3
00:01:13,422 --> 00:01:14,956
"Aku," teriakku.

4
00:01:14,989 --> 00:01:16,258
Aku ini...

5
00:01:19,228 --> 00:01:21,196
seorang penghibur.

6
00:01:22,063 --> 00:01:24,366
Saat tidak mengurus mesin
atau ganti oli,

7
00:01:24,399 --> 00:01:26,033
aku gitaris utama

8
00:01:26,067 --> 00:01:28,370
di Dog Night Specials
di Red Dragon Lounge.

9
00:01:28,403 --> 00:01:30,505
Band-nya biasa saja,
tapi mereka bagi hot dog gratis

10
00:01:30,539 --> 00:01:33,275
tiap Rabu malam, jadi ya lumayan.

11
00:01:33,308 --> 00:01:35,177
Aku satu-satunya orang kulit putih

12
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:37,845
di band serba kulit hitam
bernama The Esquires.

13
00:01:37,878 --> 00:01:40,081
Ya, aku bisa mengimbangi.

14
00:01:40,114 --> 00:01:44,186
Sejauh ini mereka belum menarikku
keluar panggung seperti di Apollo.

15
00:01:44,219 --> 00:01:45,554
Aku, eh...

16
00:01:45,587 --> 00:01:49,191
Aku punya mesin karaoke
yang kupakai untuk tampil solo.

17
00:01:49,224 --> 00:01:50,525
Aku nyanyi macam-macam.

18
00:01:50,559 --> 00:01:53,262
Mellencamp, Elvis, Bon Jovi.

19
00:01:53,295 --> 00:01:56,365
Dan, untuk acara-acara ini,

20
00:01:56,398 --> 00:01:58,899
aku menciptakan sebuah persona.

21
00:01:58,933 --> 00:02:02,337
Semacam... superhero rock and roll.

22
00:02:02,371 --> 00:02:05,274
Maksudku, aku tak punya jubah
atau topeng,

23
00:02:05,307 --> 00:02:07,442
tapi aku punya...

24
00:02:07,476 --> 00:02:09,177
kilat.

25
00:02:09,211 --> 00:02:11,879
Kau tahu kenapa aku punya
simbol kilat?

26
00:02:12,947 --> 00:02:15,217
Karena mereka memanggilku Lightning.

27
00:02:17,252 --> 00:02:18,919
Ya.

28
00:02:18,953 --> 00:02:21,423
Lightning itu bintang.

29
00:02:21,456 --> 00:02:23,558
Lightning itu dewa rock.

30
00:02:23,592 --> 00:02:28,029
Ia seperti Chuck Berry, Barry Manilow,
dan The Beatles jadi satu.

31
00:02:28,062 --> 00:02:28,996
Ya.

32
00:02:29,030 --> 00:02:31,533
Ia menyanyikan lagu-lagu
yang orang suka dengar.

33
00:02:31,566 --> 00:02:34,035
Lagu-lagu yang orang butuhkan.

34
00:02:34,068 --> 00:02:36,204
Lagu-lagu yang kubutuhkan.

35
00:02:40,175 --> 00:02:41,842
Ya.

36
00:02:43,345 --> 00:02:45,280
Lagu-lagu yang kubutuhkan...

37
00:02:45,314 --> 00:02:47,081
untuk terus bertahan.

38
00:02:49,618 --> 00:02:52,154
Saat...

39
00:02:52,187 --> 00:02:54,456
lagunya selesai
dan tepuk tangan berhenti,

40
00:02:54,489 --> 00:02:56,525
aku bukan... Lightning lagi.

41
00:02:56,558 --> 00:02:58,826
Aku cuma pemabuk biasa.

42
00:02:59,661 --> 00:03:02,464
Halo. Namaku Mike,
dan aku pecandu alkohol.

43
00:03:02,497 --> 00:03:03,864
Hai, Mike.

44
00:03:03,898 --> 00:03:06,201
Dan aku senang berada di sini

45
00:03:06,234 --> 00:03:08,470
karena hari ini hari istimewa.

46
00:03:08,503 --> 00:03:11,206
Ini hari ulang tahunku yang sadar.

47
00:03:11,239 --> 00:03:13,375
Dua puluh tahun lepas botol,
dan terus bertambah.

48
00:03:16,345 --> 00:03:17,479
Terima kasih.

49
00:03:17,512 --> 00:03:20,081
Baik.

50
00:03:20,114 --> 00:03:22,617
Tapi aku punya tradisi
di hari ulang tahun sadarku.

51
00:03:22,651 --> 00:03:25,986
Aku menyanyikan lagu yang sama
karya seorang pria hebat.

52
00:03:26,020 --> 00:03:29,056
Pria yang lagunya
menemaniku di masa-masa sulit,

53
00:03:29,090 --> 00:03:32,993
di titik-titik terendah, dan...

54
00:03:33,027 --> 00:03:36,231
hari ini aku menyanyikan
salah satu lagunya untuk kalian.

55
00:03:36,264 --> 00:03:39,234
<i>Tapi ini bukan lagu sedih</i>

56
00:03:39,267 --> 00:03:44,373
<i>Lagu sedih untuk dinyanyikan
saat kau sendiri</i>

57
00:03:45,072 --> 00:03:49,110
<i>Dalam arti tertentu,
ini lagu bahagia</i>

58
00:03:49,143 --> 00:03:52,046
<i>Lagu bahagia, lagu sederhana</i>

59
00:03:52,079 --> 00:03:54,516
<i>Yang entah kenapa
membuatmu merasa baik</i>

60
00:03:54,549 --> 00:03:58,587
<i>Saat kau ikut bernyanyi</i>

61
00:04:02,424 --> 00:04:05,627
<i>Song sung blue</i>

62
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:07,696
<i>Semua orang tahu satu</i>

63
00:04:07,729 --> 00:04:09,498
Kau tahu liriknya. Ayo.

64
00:04:11,199 --> 00:04:14,469
<i>Song sung blue</i>

65
00:04:14,503 --> 00:04:17,672
<i>Setiap taman menumbuhkannya</i>

66
00:04:17,706 --> 00:04:20,141
"Aku dan kau akan mengalami..."

67
00:04:20,175 --> 00:04:24,579
<i>Aku dan kau akan mengalami</i>

68
00:04:24,613 --> 00:04:28,115
<i>Rasa sedih, sesekali</i>

69
00:04:29,518 --> 00:04:33,455
<i>Tapi saat kau mengambil duka</i>

70
00:04:33,488 --> 00:04:36,391
<i>Dan menjadikannya lagu</i>

71
00:04:36,391 --> 00:04:40,995
<i>Kau menyanyikannya lagi</i>

72
00:04:43,063 --> 00:04:46,168
<i>Song sung blue</i>

73
00:04:46,201 --> 00:04:48,703
<i>Menangis seperti pohon willow</i>

74
00:04:51,740 --> 00:04:55,042
<i>Song sung blue</i>

75
00:04:55,075 --> 00:04:58,246
<i>Tertidur di bantalku</i>

76
00:05:01,550 --> 00:05:03,318
<i>Lucunya</i>

77
00:05:03,351 --> 00:05:08,223
<i>Kau bisa menyanyikannya
dengan tangis di suaramu</i>

78
00:05:10,192 --> 00:05:13,728
<i>Dan tanpa sadar
kau mulai merasa baik</i>

79
00:05:13,762 --> 00:05:17,566
<i>Kau memang tak punya pilihan</i>

80
00:05:21,203 --> 00:05:23,070
<i>Seluruh cintaku</i>

81
00:05:23,103 --> 00:05:24,473
<i>Seluruh ciumanku</i>

82
00:05:24,506 --> 00:05:26,475
<i>Kau tak tahu
apa yang telah kau lewatkan</i>

83
00:05:26,508 --> 00:05:27,676
<i>Oh, sayang</i>

84
00:05:27,709 --> 00:05:29,611
<i>Saat kau bersamaku</i>

85
00:05:29,644 --> 00:05:35,115
<i>Dunia bisa melihat
kau memang ditakdirkan untukku</i>

86
00:05:35,884 --> 00:05:38,753
<i>Bintang bermunculan
dan bayangan jatuh</i>

87
00:05:38,787 --> 00:05:41,289
<i>Kau bisa mendengar
hatiku memanggil</i>

88
00:05:41,323 --> 00:05:43,758
<i>Sedikit cinta membuat segalanya benar</i>

89
00:05:43,792 --> 00:05:46,161
<i>Malam ini aku akan
menemui kekasihku</i>

90
00:05:46,194 --> 00:05:48,530
<i>Seluruh cintaku,
seluruh ciumanku</i>

91
00:05:48,563 --> 00:05:51,098
<i>Kau tak tahu apa
yang telah kau lewatkan</i>

92
00:05:51,131 --> 00:05:52,601
<i>Oh, sayang...</i>

93
00:05:52,634 --> 00:05:54,034
Kau seharusnya jadi siapa?

94
00:05:54,068 --> 00:05:55,504
Hai, Earl.

95
00:05:55,537 --> 00:05:57,439
Kupikir kau di Florida,
liburan kapal pesiar atau semacamnya.

96
00:05:57,472 --> 00:06:01,510
Ya, kukira kau akan jadi Don Ho,
menyanyikan "Tiny Bubbles."

97
00:06:01,543 --> 00:06:04,111
Ya, aku tidak akan melakukan itu.
Aku tampil sebagai Lightning.

98
00:06:04,144 --> 00:06:05,514
Kau tidak bisa tampil
dengan tampilan begitu.

99
00:06:05,547 --> 00:06:07,249
Kau terlalu mirip Elvis.

100
00:06:07,282 --> 00:06:09,184
Maksudku, kau dari kepala
sampai kaki denim,

101
00:06:09,217 --> 00:06:10,452
seperti yang ia pakai
di Comeback '68.

102
00:06:10,485 --> 00:06:13,053
Ia pakai kulit hitam
di Comeback '68, bukan denim.

103
00:06:13,087 --> 00:06:16,090
Tidak saat medley "Guitar Man."
Ia pakai denim.

104
00:06:16,123 --> 00:06:17,692
Dan kau bahkan punya simbol kilat.

105
00:06:17,726 --> 00:06:20,161
Aku Lightning.
Aku tidak boleh pakai kilat?

106
00:06:20,195 --> 00:06:22,129
Itu logo Elvis.

107
00:06:22,163 --> 00:06:24,533
"Urusan beres dalam sekejap."

108
00:06:24,566 --> 00:06:26,133
Itu aku. Itu julukanku.

109
00:06:26,167 --> 00:06:27,602
Kau pemiliknya?/
TCB.

110
00:06:27,636 --> 00:06:29,371
Baiklah.

111
00:06:29,404 --> 00:06:32,474
Aku satu-satunya
peniru Elvis di Milwaukee.

112
00:06:35,109 --> 00:06:37,077
Terima kasih banyak.

113
00:06:37,111 --> 00:06:38,713
Akan kembali lagi.

114
00:06:38,747 --> 00:06:44,084
Yang jelas, peniru Elvis terlalu banyak,
tapi tak satu pun Little Richard.

115
00:06:44,118 --> 00:06:45,554
Ucapkan dengan lantang.

116
00:06:45,587 --> 00:06:47,589
Mana kemeja Hawaiinya?

117
00:06:47,622 --> 00:06:48,823
Kau menyanyikan "Tiny Bubbles."

118
00:06:48,857 --> 00:06:50,258
Aku tak mau menyanyikan
"Tiny Bubbles."

119
00:06:50,292 --> 00:06:51,593
Aku akan menyanyikan
"Eye of the Tiger,"

120
00:06:51,626 --> 00:06:53,395
lalu menutup dengan
"Suspicious Minds."

121
00:06:53,428 --> 00:06:55,430
Lewati mayatku dulu
dia menyanyikan "Suspicious Minds."

122
00:06:55,463 --> 00:06:57,399
Earl, tenanglah.
Mike.

123
00:06:57,432 --> 00:06:59,200
Apa?/
Kita ini peniru.

124
00:06:59,234 --> 00:07:01,803
Makanya panitia memesan kita
untuk penonton berambut abu-abu.

125
00:07:01,836 --> 00:07:03,572
Aku tak mirip Don Ho.

126
00:07:03,605 --> 00:07:05,139
Aku bukan orang Hawaii.
Ini konyol.

127
00:07:05,173 --> 00:07:08,108
Makanya dulu Carl Kahananui
yang membawakannya,

128
00:07:08,142 --> 00:07:09,578
tapi kantung empedunya pecah.

129
00:07:09,611 --> 00:07:11,580
Kau setuju menggantikannya
dan menolongku.

130
00:07:11,613 --> 00:07:14,783
Jadi tak ada Lightning?
Don Ho atau batal?

131
00:07:14,816 --> 00:07:17,352
Ya, Mike. Itu maksudku.

132
00:07:21,489 --> 00:07:23,758
Kalau begitu, batal.

133
00:07:23,792 --> 00:07:26,194
Claire, giliranmu.

134
00:07:26,227 --> 00:07:32,132
Babs, daripada "Don't Rain on My Parade,"
nyanyikan "People Who Need People."

135
00:07:32,167 --> 00:07:33,768
Para ubanan kehilangan
lagu dansa pelan mereka

136
00:07:33,802 --> 00:07:35,203
karena "Tiny Bubbles" dibatalkan.

137
00:07:35,236 --> 00:07:36,871
Aku akan mengatasinya...

138
00:07:36,905 --> 00:07:38,406
kurasa.

139
00:07:38,440 --> 00:07:39,774
Terima kasih, Mike.

140
00:07:39,808 --> 00:07:41,276
Sex Machine, kau penutupnya.

141
00:07:41,309 --> 00:07:42,844
Aku beri tahu band./
Baik.

142
00:07:46,247 --> 00:07:48,550
Kau seharusnya Loretta Lynn?

143
00:07:49,584 --> 00:07:50,885
Patsy Cline.

144
00:07:50,919 --> 00:07:52,354
Aku sering menyanyikan lagunya.

145
00:07:52,387 --> 00:07:53,855
Biasanya aku tak berpakaian begini,

146
00:07:53,888 --> 00:07:55,390
tapi kalau ada kesempatan bernyanyi,
ya tahu sendiri.

147
00:07:55,423 --> 00:07:57,726
Ya, aku hanya tak bisa jadi Don Ho
di hari ulang tahunku.

148
00:07:58,760 --> 00:08:00,161
Selamat ulang tahun.

149
00:08:00,195 --> 00:08:02,430
Sebenarnya bukan ulang tahunku.

150
00:08:02,464 --> 00:08:05,200
Baik.

151
00:08:07,936 --> 00:08:10,672
Kau tahu, kau bisa jadi Frank Sinatra.

152
00:08:10,705 --> 00:08:12,474
Mungkin menyanyikan "Luck Be a Lady."

153
00:08:12,507 --> 00:08:14,643
Ya, aku suka Frank,
tapi gaya crooner itu?

154
00:08:14,676 --> 00:08:15,944
Entahlah, aku suka bergerak.

155
00:08:15,977 --> 00:08:17,946
Aku suka nge-rock./
Ya.

156
00:08:17,979 --> 00:08:20,582
Elvis sudah meninggalkan gedung.

157
00:08:20,615 --> 00:08:22,751
Kau tahu siapa yang cocok untukmu?

158
00:08:22,784 --> 00:08:23,918
Neil Diamond.

159
00:08:23,952 --> 00:08:25,420
Tidak. Jangan.

160
00:08:25,453 --> 00:08:27,522
Aku sangat menghormati orang itu.

161
00:08:27,555 --> 00:08:29,524
Tidak, tidak, tidak./
"Sweet Caroline."

162
00:08:29,557 --> 00:08:31,559
Ya. "Ba-ba." Aku tahu./
<i>Bom, bom, bom.</i>

163
00:08:31,593 --> 00:08:33,928
Tidak, dengar.
Dia punya lagu lain juga, ya?

164
00:08:33,962 --> 00:08:37,532
Dan kalau sampai dia tahu aku
mempermainkan musiknya atau...

165
00:08:37,565 --> 00:08:39,567
seperti Earl, aku bisa bunuh diri.

166
00:08:39,601 --> 00:08:40,935
Bukan Neil. Aku...

167
00:08:40,969 --> 00:08:43,271
Kau tahu berapa bayarannya
untuk pelayaran itu?

168
00:08:43,304 --> 00:08:45,306
20.000 dolar.

169
00:08:46,474 --> 00:08:48,877
Si poseur itu dapat 20 ribu?

170
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:53,248
Nostalgia memang laku.

171
00:08:54,049 --> 00:08:56,818
Ya ampun,
aku kepanasan dengan wig ini.

172
00:08:56,851 --> 00:08:59,754
Kalau dadaku sedikit lebih besar,
aku bisa jadi Dolly.

173
00:08:59,788 --> 00:09:01,322
Kau pirang?

174
00:09:02,590 --> 00:09:04,359
Tentu saja.

175
00:09:04,392 --> 00:09:09,464
Baiklah, mari beri tepuk tangan
untuk Nn. Patsy dan The Greatest Hits.

176
00:09:09,497 --> 00:09:11,399
Semoga kau bernyanyi
seindah penampilanmu.

177
00:09:20,975 --> 00:09:23,745
<i>Aku berjalan keluar</i>

178
00:09:23,778 --> 00:09:25,914
<i>Setelah tengah malam</i>

179
00:09:25,947 --> 00:09:28,349
<i>Di bawah cahaya bulan</i>

180
00:09:28,383 --> 00:09:30,752
<i>Seperti yang dulu sering kita lakukan</i>

181
00:09:30,785 --> 00:09:33,388
<i>Aku selalu berjalan</i>

182
00:09:33,421 --> 00:09:35,023
<i>Setelah tengah malam</i>

183
00:09:35,056 --> 00:09:37,959
<i>Mencarimu...</i>

184
00:09:37,992 --> 00:09:39,861
Claire Stengl.

185
00:09:39,894 --> 00:09:42,330
Dia menyanyi country, rock,

186
00:09:42,363 --> 00:09:44,733
bahkan klasik seperti "Ave Maria" itu.

187
00:09:46,434 --> 00:09:48,470
Dia kelihatan cantik, bukan?

188
00:09:48,503 --> 00:09:50,605
Hah! Ya!

189
00:09:50,638 --> 00:09:52,607
Kawanku Lightning.

190
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:54,743
<i>Setelah tengah malam</i>

191
00:09:54,776 --> 00:09:57,479
<i>Mencarimu</i>

192
00:09:59,547 --> 00:10:02,851
<i>Aku berhenti melihat
pohon willow menangis</i>

193
00:10:02,884 --> 00:10:05,487
<i>Meneteskan air mata di bantalnya</i>

194
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:09,491
<i>Mungkin dia menangis untukku</i>

195
00:10:09,524 --> 00:10:12,360
<i>Dan saat langit makin muram</i>

196
00:10:12,393 --> 00:10:14,529
<i>Angin malam berbisik padaku</i>

197
00:10:14,562 --> 00:10:18,900
<i>Aku sesunyi yang kurasakan</i>

198
00:10:18,933 --> 00:10:21,402
<i>Aku berjalan keluar</i>

199
00:10:21,436 --> 00:10:23,705
<i>Setelah tengah malam</i>

200
00:10:23,738 --> 00:10:26,040
<i>Di bawah cahaya bintang</i>

201
00:10:26,074 --> 00:10:28,343
<i>Hanya berharap kau ada</i>

202
00:10:28,376 --> 00:10:30,879
<i>Di suatu tempat berjalan</i>

203
00:10:30,912 --> 00:10:32,881
<i>Setelah tengah malam</i>

204
00:10:32,914 --> 00:10:36,284
<i>Mencariku.</i>

205
00:10:36,951 --> 00:10:39,554
Baik, Mike.

206
00:10:40,555 --> 00:10:41,923
Buka lebar.

207
00:10:41,956 --> 00:10:43,391
Astaga.

208
00:10:43,424 --> 00:10:45,794
Mobil bisa parkir di celah itu.

209
00:10:45,827 --> 00:10:47,662
Aku ambil Cadillac saja.

210
00:10:47,695 --> 00:10:51,032
Aku punya sesuatu
yang jauh lebih bagus.

211
00:10:51,065 --> 00:10:53,835
Coba lihat...

212
00:10:53,868 --> 00:10:55,837
ini.

213
00:11:00,575 --> 00:11:02,110
Itu kilat?

214
00:11:02,143 --> 00:11:04,512
Kilat untuk Lightning.

215
00:11:04,546 --> 00:11:06,447
Jadi saat aku tersenyum,
seolah aku beriklan.

216
00:11:06,481 --> 00:11:07,749
Itu cerdas, dr. Dave.

217
00:11:07,782 --> 00:11:10,618
Makanya kau manajerku, dr. Dave.

218
00:11:10,652 --> 00:11:11,653
Selalu berpikir ke depan.

219
00:11:11,686 --> 00:11:15,123
Aku dapat telepon dari Walter
di First National.

220
00:11:15,157 --> 00:11:16,825
Pertama,

221
00:11:16,858 --> 00:11:18,560
dia masih ingin kau tampil
di pesta Natalnya.

222
00:11:18,593 --> 00:11:20,495
Bagus./
Kedua,

223
00:11:20,528 --> 00:11:23,431
kau menunggak
cicilan rumah tiga bulan.

224
00:11:23,464 --> 00:11:25,767
Tak bisakah dia memotongnya
dari honor tampilku?

225
00:11:25,800 --> 00:11:28,002
Mike, ini bukan sesuatu
yang bisa kau nyanyikan begitu saja.

226
00:11:28,036 --> 00:11:30,138
Mungkin kau harus
memikirkan rumah yang lebih kecil.

